Section/subsection name: Paragraph 1
Content:

The main problem is to efficiently find the point at a specific rank i. Problem 1 (κ-Random-Access Ranked Retrieval (κ-RAR)). Given a datasetDavailable at preprocessing time, a query consists of a linear scoring function f∈Rdand an integer i∈[n], find a

